  Slug: emerald-boughs
  DisplayName: Emerald Boughs
  IconPath: icons/magic/nature/tree-bare-glow-yellow.webp
  Description: "Emerald Boughs value the societies and natural communities of the
    present day, seeking to understand the world as it is and how magic operates
    therein. Emphasizing camaraderie and sociality, these students tend to be the
    ones that most eagerly embrace the Magaambya's \"practical magic\" curriculum
    where they leave campus and work within communities. While some of these students
    have been accused of spying for the school, espionage is not an official part
    of their curriculum. Magic that can serve or sway others\u2014as well as magic
    that reveals knowledge or allows access to it\u2014is, instead, at the heart
    of this curriculum. Additional Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon
    Instrument] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Charm], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disguise
    Magic] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Revealing Light] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hypnotize]
    4th: Confusion 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scouting Eye] 6th:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scrying] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.True
    Target] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disappearance] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Foresight]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Rival Academies
